# The bridge runs as hyperflux-next and the device keeper as
# hyperflux-keeper, each with a group of the same name. Nobody else may ever
# join hyperflux-keeper: the patched OpenRazer drivers trust virtual devices
# because only that group can create them. The hyperflux group may connect
# to the sockets in /run/hyperflux-next: the bridge's, and the keeper's to
# the bridge.
u hyperflux-next - "HyperFlux Next V2 bridge" - -
u hyperflux-keeper - "HyperFlux Next V2 device keeper" - -
g hyperflux - -
m hyperflux-next hyperflux
m hyperflux-keeper hyperflux
